    # 2026-10-01 第五批（全量查證，子代理搜尋、逐條引文以 check_quotes 核對）· fifth batch, every quote checked
    F5('CHN', 'CGN Huizhou Gangkou I & II', 'jk', url='http://www.news.cn/fortune/2023-12/13/c_1130023531.htm',
       zh='共104座：一期25萬kW（6.45 MW機組）2021-12-28全容量併網，二期75萬kW（PA區10×8.5＋20×12＋9×14 MW等）2023-12-12投產；新華社說該項目「創新研發了具有新型過渡段結構的深水區導管架基礎」，一期招標亦為導管架預製與施工（Ⅲ標段12套預製、20套沉樁施工），2021-07「秦航工2300」在惠州海域吊裝導管架（新華網2023-12-13、國資委2023-12-15、中國能建2023-12-18、中國電力招標網2020-06-27、搜狐2021-07-21）。',
       en='104 turbines in all: phase I 250 MW (6.45 MW units) fully grid-connected 2021-12-28, phase II 750 MW (PA block 10 x 8.5 + 20 x 12 + 9 x 14 MW etc.) commissioned 2023-12-12. Xinhua says the project ’developed a deep-water jacket foundation with a new transition-piece structure’; the phase I tenders were also for jacket prefabrication and installation (lot III: 12 jackets prefabricated, 20 driven) and in July 2021 the crane vessel Qinhanggong 2300 installed jackets in Huizhou waters (Xinhua 2023-12-13, SASAC 2023-12-15, CEEC 2023-12-18, dlztb 2020-06-27, Sohu 2021-07-21).'),
    F5('CHN', 'Guangdong Zhanjiang Xuwen Offshore wind farm', 'mp', url='https://m.gdzjdaily.com.cn/p/2816813.html',
       zh='原場600 MW＝94×6.45 MW，2021-11-26全部併網，報導稱「30天內完成單樁沉樁20根」（湛江日報2021-11-26）；300 MW增容＝25×12 MW，「風機基礎全部採用單樁基礎」（樁徑8.75–9.7 m），2024-12-17全容量併網（搜狐／龍船風電網2023-09-21、2024-07-03，CPEM 2024）。原場94座未見逐場型式說明，僅有單樁沉樁報導。',
       en='Original 600 MW = 94 x 6.45 MW, all grid-connected 2021-11-26, with reports of ’20 monopiles driven in 30 days’ (Zhanjiang Daily 2021-11-26); the 300 MW extension = 25 x 12 MW, ’all turbine foundations are monopiles’ (8.75-9.7 m diameter), fully connected 2024-12-17 (Sohu/Longchuan 2023-09-21 and 2024-07-03, CPEM 2024). No explicit statement covers all 94 original turbines, only the monopile-driving report.'),
